[
  {
    "content_id": "10055001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;奉　神旨意，照着在基督耶稣里生命的应许，作基督耶稣使徒的保罗</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;写信给我亲爱的儿子提摩太。愿恩惠、怜悯、平安从父　神和我们主基督耶稣归与你！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我感谢　神，就是我接续祖先用清洁的良心所事奉的　神。祈祷的时候，不住的想念你，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;记念你的眼泪，昼夜切切地想要见你，好叫我满心快乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;想到你心里无伪之信，这信是先在你外祖母罗以和你母亲友妮基心里的，我深信也在你的心里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;为此我提醒你，使你将　神借我按手所给你的恩赐再如火挑旺起来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为　神赐给我们，不是胆怯的心，乃是刚强、仁爱、谨守的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你不要以给我们的主作见证为耻，也不要以我这为主被囚的为耻；总要按　神的能力，与我为福音同受苦难。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;神救了我们，以圣召召我们，不是按我们的行为，乃是按他的旨意和恩典；这恩典是万古之先，在基督耶稣里赐给我们的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但如今借着我们救主基督耶稣的显现才表明出来了。他已经把死废去，借着福音，将不能坏的生命彰显出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我为这福音奉派作传道的，作使徒，作师傅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;为这缘故，我也受这些苦难。然而我不以为耻；因为知道我所信的是谁，也深信他能保全我所交付他的，直到那日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你从我听的那纯正话语的规模，要用在基督耶稣里的信心和爱心，常常守着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;从前所交托你的善道，你要靠着那住在我们里面的圣灵牢牢地守着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;凡在亚细亚的人都离弃我，这是你知道的，其中有腓吉路和黑摩其尼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿主怜悯阿尼色弗一家的人；因他屡次使我畅快，不以我的锁链为耻，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;反倒在罗马的时候，殷勤地找我，并且找着了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;愿主使他在那日得主的怜悯。他在以弗所怎样多多地服事我，是你明明知道的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我儿啊，你要在基督耶稣的恩典上刚强起来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你在许多见证人面前听见我所教训的，也要交托那忠心能教导别人的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要和我同受苦难，好像基督耶稣的精兵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;凡在军中当兵的，不将世务缠身，好叫那招他当兵的人喜悦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;人若在场上比武，非按规矩，就不能得冠冕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;劳力的农夫理当先得粮食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我所说的话，你要思想，因为凡事主必给你聪明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你要记念耶稣基督乃是大卫的后裔，他从死里复活，正合乎我所传的福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我为这福音受苦难，甚至被捆绑，像犯人一样。然而　神的道却不被捆绑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，我为选民凡事忍耐，叫他们也可以得着那在基督耶稣里的救恩和永远的荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;有可信的话说： 我们若与基督同死，也必与他同活；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们若能忍耐，也必和他一同作王。 我们若不认他，他也必不认我们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我们纵然失信，他仍是可信的， 因为他不能背乎自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你要使众人回想这些事，在主面前嘱咐他们：不可为言语争辩；这是没有益处的，只能败坏听见的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你当竭力在　神面前得蒙喜悦，作无愧的工人，按着正意分解真理的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但要远避世俗的虚谈，因为这等人必进到更不敬虔的地步。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他们的话如同毒疮，越烂越大；其中有许米乃和腓理徒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他们偏离了真道，说复活的事已过，就败坏好些人的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;然而，　神坚固的根基立住了；上面有这印记说：「主认识谁是他的人」；又说：「凡称呼主名的人总要离开不义。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;在大户人家，不但有金器银器，也有木器瓦器；有作为贵重的，有作为卑贱的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;人若自洁，脱离卑贱的事，就必作贵重的器皿，成为圣洁，合乎主用，预备行各样的善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你要逃避少年的私欲，同那清心祷告主的人追求公义、信德、仁爱、和平。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;惟有那愚拙无学问的辩论，总要弃绝，因为知道这等事是起争竞的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;然而主的仆人不可争竞，只要温温和和地待众人，善于教导，存心忍耐，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;用温柔劝戒那抵挡的人；或者　神给他们悔改的心，可以明白真道，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;叫他们这已经被魔鬼任意掳去的，可以醒悟，脱离他的网罗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你该知道，末世必有危险的日子来到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;因为那时，人要专顾自己，贪爱钱财，自夸，狂傲，谤 ，违背父母，忘恩负义，心不圣洁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;无亲情，不解怨，好说谗言，不能自约，性情凶暴，不爱良善，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;卖主卖友，任意妄为，自高自大，爱宴乐，不爱　神，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;有敬虔的外貌，却背了敬虔的实意；这等人你要躲开。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那偷进人家、牢笼无知妇女的，正是这等人。这些妇女担负罪恶，被各样的私欲引诱，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;常常学习，终久不能明白真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;从前雅尼和佯庇怎样敌挡摩西，这等人也怎样敌挡真道。他们的心地坏了，在真道上是可废弃的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;然而他们不能再这样敌挡；因为他们的愚昧必在众人面前显露出来，像那二人一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但你已经服从了我的教训、品行、志向、信心、宽容、爱心、忍耐，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;以及我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得所遭遇的逼迫、苦难。我所忍受是何等的逼迫；但从这一切苦难中，主都把我救出来了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不但如此，凡立志在基督耶稣里敬虔度日的也都要受逼迫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;只是作恶的和迷惑人的，必越久越恶，他欺哄人，也被人欺哄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但你所学习的，所确信的，要存在心里；因为你知道是跟谁学的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;并且知道你是从小明白圣经，这圣经能使你因信基督耶稣，有得救的智慧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;圣经都是　神所默示的，于教训、督责、使人归正、教导人学义都是有益的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;叫属　神的人得以完全，预备行各样的善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我在　神面前，并在将来审判活人死人的基督耶稣面前，凭着他的显现和他的国度嘱咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;务要传道，无论得时不得时总要专心，并用百般的忍耐、各样的教训责备人，警戒人，劝勉人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为时候要到，人必厌烦纯正的道理，耳朵发痒，就随从自己的情欲，增添好些师傅，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;并且掩耳不听真道，偏向荒渺的言语。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你却要凡事谨慎，忍受苦难，做传道的工夫，尽你的职分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我现在被浇奠，我离世的时候到了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;那美好的仗我已经打过了，当跑的路我已经跑尽了，所信的道我已经守住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;从此以后，有公义的冠冕为我存留，就是按着公义审判的主到了那日要赐给我的；不但赐给我，也赐给凡爱慕他显现的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你要赶紧地到我这里来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为底马贪爱现今的世界，就离弃我往帖撒罗尼迦去了；革勒士往加拉太去；提多往挞马太去；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;独有路加在我这里。你来的时候，要把马可带来，因为他在传道的事上于我有益处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我已经打发推基古往以弗所去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我在特罗亚留于加布的那件外衣，你来的时候可以带来，那些书也要带来，更要紧的是那些皮卷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;铜匠亚历山大多多地害我；主必照他所行的报应他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你也要防备他，因为他极力敌挡了我们的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我初次申诉，没有人前来帮助，竟都离弃我；但愿这罪不归与他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;惟有主站在我旁边，加给我力量，使福音被我尽都传明，叫外邦人都听见；我也从狮子口里被救出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;主必救我脱离诸般的凶恶，也必救我进他的天国。愿荣耀归给他，直到永永远远。阿们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;问百基拉、亚居拉，和阿尼色弗一家的人安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;以拉都在哥林多住下了。特罗非摩病了，我就留他在米利都。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你要赶紧在冬天以前到我这里来。有友布罗、布田、利奴、革老底亚，和众弟兄都问你安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;愿主与你的灵同在！愿恩惠常与你们同在！</p>"
  }
]